<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">7643t[mnvz - Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yudasi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yudasi</para>
  <para style="toc1">lihamba lya Paulo kwa Yudasi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yudasi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Lihamba hali lingukemwa Yudasi likipapa lihina lya mweni kuyandika. Yudasi angutambulisa yiwa mweni ni mlongo wa Yakobu avile mlongo wa Yesu. Hinu hilahila angukwinilwa yiwa Yudasi ni paghati walongo ghaki Yesu kusula gha Yudasi 1. Tungumanya ng'ogha yiwa lihamba hali liyandikilwi kwa lipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito liki na hai ni kwaikiva ngumbungumbu zyaki zinguhuma kulilaghano lya dahile, wasoma wa mtumbula wa kihitabu kya Yudasi ni wawelili Wayahudi. Pamonga na yiwa, awayandikili lihamba hali “Wogha weni kukemwa, wala weni kupalwa na Sapanga Tati na kugholokelwa na Bambu Yesu Kilisito” (Yudasi 1). Lihamba hali ingukwinilwa liyandikilwi machuva gha isitini badili gha kuhova Yesu Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lukasini lwa kuyandika lihamba hali ni kuwayandikila wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito wogha ili kuwakanisa wakotoho kubyodoswa kwa mavulo gha uhwangi Yudasi 4. Angutumila yala yagholilwi kuhuma lilaghano lya dahile na anguwachila ili kuyapegha utopa hagha anguyalongela. Lihamba hali liwela na mawachilo matangala kuhuma lihamba lya ivili lya Petelo pamonga na makaniso kunani gha habali gha wavula gha uhwangi Judi 4, Lihamba lya ivili gha Petelo 2:1 hilahila na yeni kuhumila kummbwani wa Sodoma na Gomola</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha Mghati</para>
  <para style="io">Yudasi angutumbula kwa kuwatambulisa wasoma ghaki 1-2</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi angulongela kwa kyani ayandikili lihamba hali na yeni ni kuwakanisa wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito walikali kutali na wavula wa uhwangi ku Yudasi 3-4</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi anguwapegha milandano kuhuma kwa wandu wa dahile na matendu yawonikanili kulilaghanu lya dahile 2-16</para>
  <para style="io">Hilahila akawalongela kila wangupalwa kughola 17-23</para>
  <para style="io">Mwihu anguyomola lihamba lyaki kwa kumsifila Sapanga 24-25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Nenga Yudasi mtumikila wa Yesu Kilisito na mlongo wa Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">ninguwayandikila mwenga wogha mkemilwi na Tati Sapanga na weni kupalwa na Sapanga, na weni kugholokelwa maha na Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Ningumyupa Sapanga awapeghi luhungu ghaki, kulikala kwa kuponga pamonga na upalo ghaki mkulu.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wavula wa uhwangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Walongu wapalwa, niwelili na lukani lwa kuwayandikila kunani gha hula ulokola tuwela nau, ila nilola yiwa ni lasima niwayandikili kuwakasila muyendileli kuyangala kukukwinila kula Sapanga kawapegha wandu ghaki lihanja limonga hela kwa lipindi lyogha. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Ninguwayandikila lihamba hali kwaikiva kuwela na wandu watenu weni kumyitikila ng'ogha Sapanga, waliyingisa kwa kifisu na kulihanganya na mwenga, wandu hagha wangubyodosa Habali gha umaha wa Sapanga wa twenga, ili wagholi sambi na kumkanila Yesu Kilisito mwenikuwela kilongosi mkulu na Bambu wa twenga. Ila kuhuma dahile iyandikwa yiwa wandu hagha watetoswa.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Pamonga na yiwa mmanya kala hagha hyogha, ningupala kuwakumbusila yiwa Bambu paawalokolile kala wandu ghaki kuhuma Misili, kuulongolo akawayalamisa wala walemili kukwinila ng'ogha, <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />hilahila mkumbwiki watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga wala wapalile mighalu mikulunga kupiti ukulu wawela nau, wakaleka pala wangupalwa kulikala, Sapanga akawavika kufwasi gha lwisa, wakiwopwa minyololu kwa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, mbaka pala watetoswa lichuwa lila likulu. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Kangi wandu wa mimbwani gha Sodoma na Gomola na mimbwani iwelile mmbalimbali, wandu hagha waigholile handa waigholile wala watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga waigholile. Hinu Sapanga akawapegha unyokolu kwa kunyanywa kyoto lya machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, ili iweli makaniso kwa wandu wogha.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Hata nagha wandu hagha weni kumyitikila ng'ogha Sapanga wangulandana na weni. Wangulongoswa na ndotu, ndotu hazi zingutaya ndaka mihigha ghao, wanguulema ukulu wa Sapanga na kulighu viumbi vikulu vya Sapanga vyenikuwela kundumba. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Hata Mikaeli, mtumikila mkulu wa kundumba wa Sapanga paawelili akisindana na Lihyukana kwaikiva gha mhigha wa Musa, ayesili ng'ogha kumtosa Lihyukana kwa malighu ghaki, ila ailongile, “Bambu Sapanga mweni na akukalipili.” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Ila wandu hagha wangulonga milando mihakata kunani gha mighalu wanguimanya ng'ogha. Na kumighalu hila wanguimanya kwa kukisila handa vila mikokolu wangukisila, hai ndiwa mighalu yeni kuwayalamisa. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Mahakata yatewakola! Weni wangukovekela njila gha Kaini. Kwaikiva gha kupala mapesa wakakovekela ndyangilu hilahila gha Baalamu, na kuyalamika kumahakata handa gha Kola vila kakosela na kuyalamiswa. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Wandu hagha wanguyegha mkolughanyu kumihambu gha mwenga gha upalo. Wangulilola weni weka pawangulyegha, weni ni handa mahindu yeni kukweghwa na liyegha na yakotoho kuyegha ndonya. ingumaanisa wanguwela ng'ogha na uchakaka kungalilu ghao, kangi ni handa mibikiyenikuwela ng'ogha na matungula lipindi lya mabeno, itupulwa hyogha na iyuma, <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />hilahila ni handa mawimbi makalipa mubahali, na matendu ghao gha honi yanguhuma handa livuluvulu. Weni ni handa ndondwa zyeni kuyeleja yeleja. Wandu hagha watevikwa kumbandi gha lwisa ngulu lwa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Enoko, mundu wa kiweka kya isaba kuhuma awoneki Adamu, akalota nagha kwa wandu handa hagha, “Uloli Bambu Sapanga anguhika pamonga na maielufu gha watumikila ghaki, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />ili kuwatosa kila mmonga mweni kumtila ng'ogha Sapanga kwa matendu ghao gha uhakata wagholile, pamonga na weni sambi vila wamlighu Sapanga.”<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Wandu hagha wangunung'unika na weni kuhakula mahakata, weni wangukovekela lumatamata lwau luhakata, wangulidumba, na kuwasifila nesu wandu weni ukulu kwaikiva gha kuipatila fwaida.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makaniso na malaghilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Ila mwenga waghanja ghangu, mkubwiki ghala mlongelilwi haku dahile na wandumindumi wa Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Walongile, “Machuwa gha kumwihu kutehika wandu weni kumpughanya Sapanga na kughola mighalu mihakata wanguipala weni baha.” <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Hagha ndiwa wandu weni kuwabaghula wandu mapinga mkotoho kuwela pamonga, wanguwachilila ngalilu ghao weka, na wawela ng'ogha na Mpumulo wa Sapanga. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Ila mwenga waghanja ghangu, myendileli kugholoka maha kuukwinila muwela nau mpeghwa na Sapanga, mkiyupa kwa uwesa wa Mpumulo wa Sapanga. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Myendileli kulikala kuupalo wa Sapanga mkimlindila Bambu wa twenga Yesu kilisito na kwa luhungu lwaki atewayingisa kuukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Muwawoneli luhungu wala weni kuwela kukwinila kwau kugholoka maha ng'ogha. <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />Wamonga muwalokoli kwa kuwanyasula kuhuma mulyoto, ila kwa waghangi muwawoneli luhungu kunu mkilikala kutali na weni, mkihyomela hata nguu zyau zyeni kutanywa ndaka zya lidowa lya lumatamata lwau luhakata.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyupa na kusifila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Sapanga kana makakala na anguwesa kuwaghola mkotoho kuyalamika, na anguwesa kuwayingisa kuukulu ghaki bila uhakata wowosi mghati gha mwenga na akawapegha luheku lukulunga, <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />Sapanga mwenikuwela waweka, mlokola wa twenga, mweni kusifilwa na ukulu, makakala na ulongosi kupitila Kilisito Bambu wa twenga, kuhuma dahile hinaa na hata machuwa hyogha bila mwihu! Hina.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>